00:00:08,920 --> 00:00:14,360
(11:50-12:00 PM)

2
00:00:14,360 --> 00:00:19,400
(11:50-12:00 PM)

3
00:00:20,693 --> 00:00:23,773
♪Your silhouette melts into the glow♪

4
00:00:25,006 --> 00:00:26,679
(Congrats to our grand prize winner!
Prize money: 100,000 yuan)

5
00:00:27,127 --> 00:00:31,037
♪I count your sighs♪

6
00:00:32,622 --> 00:00:34,663
♪Every breath♪

7
00:00:34,946 --> 00:00:37,606
♪Feels like I'm stealing♪

8
00:00:39,927 --> 00:00:41,142
♪The next second♪

9
00:00:41,659 --> 00:00:44,513
♪Before it's no longer mine♪

10
00:00:48,054 --> 00:00:50,020
♪We live♪
(Capernaum)

11
00:00:50,020 --> 00:00:54,263
♪In the spaces between moments♪

12
00:00:56,241 --> 00:01:00,776
♪Breathing through each other's shadows♪

13
00:01:02,059 --> 00:01:05,010
♪Let's not speak of what's to come♪

14
00:01:05,353 --> 00:01:08,158
♪Or what came before♪

15
00:01:09,778 --> 00:01:14,486
♪This moment could last me a lifetime♪
(12:00-11:50 PM)

16
00:01:16,210 --> 00:01:20,925
=Thirteen Types of Love=
=Episode 16=

17
00:01:22,080 --> 00:01:24,800
Bring me the file on the second shelf.

18
00:01:27,240 --> 00:01:27,960
The black one.

19
00:01:29,600 --> 00:01:31,440
It's the fourth one

20
00:01:31,440 --> 00:01:32,440
from the left.

21
00:01:34,553 --> 00:01:36,346
(3C-091NB)

22
00:01:39,966 --> 00:01:42,494
(3C-091NB)

23
00:01:42,520 --> 00:01:43,920
A block was planted

24
00:01:44,240 --> 00:01:45,920
in your consciousness.

25
00:01:46,480 --> 00:01:48,240
If anyone tried to probe it,

26
00:01:48,360 --> 00:01:50,160
the block would fight back

27
00:01:50,480 --> 00:01:52,080
and affect the person being probed.

28
00:01:53,640 --> 00:01:55,480
I've never seen anything like this.

29
00:01:57,560 --> 00:01:58,600
So I wondered,

30
00:01:59,240 --> 00:02:00,640
(10:08)
what would the cause be?

31
00:02:00,760 --> 00:02:02,680
What triggered this chain of events?

32
00:02:04,600 --> 00:02:06,080
Chen Mo filled me in briefly.

33
00:02:07,400 --> 00:02:08,960
Your current situation is that,

34
00:02:09,240 --> 00:02:10,760
in your subconscious,

35
00:02:11,040 --> 00:02:13,520
you've completely lost your sense
of who someone is.

36
00:02:14,040 --> 00:02:15,040
To recover those memories,

37
00:02:15,120 --> 00:02:16,560
you'll have to start from the beginning.

38
00:02:18,000 --> 00:02:19,240
It won't be easy.

39
00:02:21,840 --> 00:02:23,040
As long as I can find Duo

40
00:02:23,920 --> 00:02:24,880
and be with her,

41
00:02:25,320 --> 00:02:26,280
I'm not afraid of anything.

42
00:02:27,440 --> 00:02:30,360
(10:08)
Then you'll need deep hypnosis.

43
00:02:31,880 --> 00:02:32,720
If you can't wake up...

44
00:02:35,440 --> 00:02:36,400
You may never wake up again.

45
00:02:37,480 --> 00:02:38,680
Should I

46
00:02:38,680 --> 00:02:39,880
prepare some kind of token?

47
00:02:40,280 --> 00:02:41,640
They had a spinning top in Inception.

48
00:02:42,240 --> 00:02:42,760
So for me...

49
00:02:47,520 --> 00:02:49,680
(10:08)

50
00:02:50,040 --> 00:02:51,600
Only you know what the key

51
00:02:51,960 --> 00:02:53,120
in here looks like.

52
00:02:53,280 --> 00:02:54,760
No one else can see it.

53
00:02:54,920 --> 00:02:55,800
Not even me.

54
00:02:57,160 --> 00:02:58,520
Use it well.

55
00:02:59,160 --> 00:03:00,680
It might be your way back.

56
00:03:04,460 --> 00:03:06,860
(10:06)

57
00:03:51,960 --> 00:03:52,520
Honey,

58
00:03:53,800 --> 00:03:54,480
(108)
I'm back.

59
00:03:58,240 --> 00:03:58,840
Hubby,

60
00:03:59,920 --> 00:04:00,720
I knew it.

61
00:04:01,240 --> 00:04:02,720
I knew you'd find your way home.

62
00:04:08,160 --> 00:04:09,160
You're finally here.

63
00:04:10,640 --> 00:04:12,320
I'll never let you leave me again.

64
00:04:13,000 --> 00:04:14,320
I'll never leave you again.

65
00:04:32,280 --> 00:04:33,600
Is this the cabin by the lake?

66
00:04:36,160 --> 00:04:36,680
This

67
00:04:37,320 --> 00:04:39,440
is where we wanted to get married.

68
00:04:40,720 --> 00:04:41,760
We'll have our wedding

69
00:04:41,880 --> 00:04:43,360
at that lakeside cabin

70
00:04:43,920 --> 00:04:44,880
you love so much.

71
00:04:49,800 --> 00:04:50,440
Honey,

72
00:04:50,920 --> 00:04:52,320
let's name our baby.

73
00:04:56,560 --> 00:04:57,280
My child?

74
00:04:58,880 --> 00:04:59,880
Yes, your child.

75
00:05:01,960 --> 00:05:04,080
How come I don't remember making one?

76
00:05:06,360 --> 00:05:07,240
I missed out.

77
00:05:10,160 --> 00:05:11,680
In every memory you have,

78
00:05:12,240 --> 00:05:14,120
I died because of forces
beyond my control.

79
00:05:15,280 --> 00:05:16,920
This is all from my imagination.

80
00:05:18,000 --> 00:05:18,520
Honey,

81
00:05:18,840 --> 00:05:20,320
we'll never be apart again.

82
00:05:22,240 --> 00:05:23,320
We'll always be together.

83
00:05:27,720 --> 00:05:29,320
It sounds scary at first.

84
00:05:31,000 --> 00:05:31,760
But honey,

85
00:05:33,200 --> 00:05:34,640
as long as we're together,

86
00:05:35,760 --> 00:05:36,760
nothing scares me.

87
00:05:44,000 --> 00:05:44,600
Let's name them.

88
00:05:45,240 --> 00:05:45,880
Let's pick a name.

89
00:05:48,120 --> 00:05:48,760
How about...

90
00:05:50,160 --> 00:05:50,960
Xixi?

91
00:05:52,160 --> 00:05:53,280
You sure, honey?

92
00:05:54,040 --> 00:05:54,840
My surname's Zhang.

93
00:05:55,600 --> 00:05:56,440
Zhang Xixi sounds like "dirty".
[*"Zangxixi" means "dirty" in Chinese]

94
00:06:10,360 --> 00:06:13,200
What should our child study?

95
00:06:14,040 --> 00:06:15,120
Anything but film or television.

96
00:06:15,560 --> 00:06:17,240
Don't let them become a performer
like you.

97
00:06:17,880 --> 00:06:19,040
It's too much work.

98
00:06:20,000 --> 00:06:21,680
I hope they can be a loser.

99
00:06:21,840 --> 00:06:22,600
A loser?

100
00:06:22,720 --> 00:06:23,160
Yeah.

101
00:06:23,560 --> 00:06:25,200
A loser who can still make a living.

102
00:06:29,540 --> 00:06:35,105
(00:02)

103
00:06:35,106 --> 00:06:39,280
(00:02)

104
00:06:39,280 --> 00:06:39,840
Auntie,

105
00:06:40,760 --> 00:06:41,880
it's been three hours.

106
00:06:42,800 --> 00:06:43,880
Shouldn't we wake him up?

107
00:06:46,320 --> 00:06:47,160
No.

108
00:06:48,600 --> 00:06:50,680
With hypnosis this deep,

109
00:06:51,160 --> 00:06:53,080
you can't wake someone all at once.

110
00:06:57,360 --> 00:07:00,400
You have to do it gradually.

111
00:07:00,960 --> 00:07:01,880
My aunt

112
00:07:02,960 --> 00:07:04,200
really is unreliable.

113
00:07:16,600 --> 00:07:18,520
Switch to the phase-two music.

114
00:07:36,640 --> 00:07:39,780
(Club Odeon)

115
00:08:07,720 --> 00:08:08,320
Daddy!

116
00:08:10,960 --> 00:08:11,600
Daddy,

117
00:08:11,720 --> 00:08:13,240
my brothers won't play with me.

118
00:08:14,960 --> 00:08:16,520
Not only are you calling me Daddy,

119
00:08:17,240 --> 00:08:18,480
you've got brothers too?

120
00:08:18,640 --> 00:08:20,120
Big brother won't play with me.

121
00:08:20,760 --> 00:08:23,000
Neither will my other two brothers.

122
00:08:26,680 --> 00:08:27,280
Kiddo,

123
00:08:28,280 --> 00:08:30,240
how unwanted are you?

124
00:08:31,120 --> 00:08:32,520
I'll go find Mommy!

125
00:08:39,680 --> 00:08:40,160
Hubby.

126
00:08:42,640 --> 00:08:43,240
Wifey,

127
00:08:44,200 --> 00:08:46,200
how come we have so many kids?

128
00:08:47,680 --> 00:08:49,680
Because you love children deep down.

129
00:08:50,240 --> 00:08:51,080
So,

130
00:08:52,120 --> 00:08:54,480
I imagined lots and lots of kids.

131
00:08:58,280 --> 00:08:59,080
They're all yours.

132
00:09:00,640 --> 00:09:02,240
I do love kids.

133
00:09:03,760 --> 00:09:05,800
But don't skip how we made them.

134
00:09:10,640 --> 00:09:11,680
Is that part

135
00:09:12,600 --> 00:09:13,960
really so much fun?

136
00:09:16,400 --> 00:09:17,280
Oh,

137
00:09:18,280 --> 00:09:19,760
it's a lot of fun.

138
00:09:23,360 --> 00:09:25,440
Because you absolutely refuse
to share that part,

139
00:09:26,200 --> 00:09:27,640
every time you input data into me,

140
00:09:28,720 --> 00:09:29,840
you leave it out.

141
00:09:31,720 --> 00:09:32,440
Input...

142
00:09:33,240 --> 00:09:34,440
Input what into you?

143
00:09:38,660 --> 00:09:41,673
(108)

144
00:09:44,733 --> 00:09:46,733
(108)

145
00:09:47,160 --> 00:09:48,520
(Warning:)

146
00:09:48,840 --> 00:09:50,560
(Subject Zhang Yongsen)

147
00:09:50,560 --> 00:09:52,480
(is under extreme emotional stress.)

148
00:09:53,360 --> 00:09:55,320
(And even if I went in to save you,)

149
00:09:56,440 --> 00:09:57,840
(I couldn't pull it off.)

150
00:09:57,840 --> 00:10:00,120
(He will disappear in five minutes.)

151
00:10:01,280 --> 00:10:04,240
(Subject Zhang Yongsen's consciousness
is fading.)

152
00:10:04,560 --> 00:10:06,720
(Final countdown has begun.)

153
00:10:07,560 --> 00:10:08,040
(Five.)

154
00:10:08,440 --> 00:10:09,200
(Four.)

155
00:10:09,680 --> 00:10:10,400
(Three.)

156
00:10:10,640 --> 00:10:11,240
(Two.)

157
00:10:11,440 --> 00:10:13,560
(Detected that Subject 108 Lin Duo)

158
00:10:13,800 --> 00:10:15,840
(is using memories of the original self
across multiple universes)

159
00:10:16,040 --> 00:10:18,960
(to correct Subject Zhang Yongsen's
distorted worldview.)

160
00:10:19,280 --> 00:10:22,640
(His consciousness is recovering.)

161
00:10:23,320 --> 00:10:24,480
(I'm Lin Duo.)

162
00:10:25,160 --> 00:10:26,480
(When you open your eyes,)

163
00:10:26,920 --> 00:10:27,840
(you'll believe)

164
00:10:28,600 --> 00:10:29,240
(I)

165
00:10:30,320 --> 00:10:31,680
(am Lin Duo.)

166
00:10:32,520 --> 00:10:34,360
(Subject Zhang Yongsen)

167
00:10:34,600 --> 00:10:36,480
(has fully recovered.)

168
00:10:40,600 --> 00:10:41,280
(Marry me.)

169
00:10:41,280 --> 00:10:42,080
(Because Lin Duo's consciousness)

170
00:10:42,080 --> 00:10:45,565
- (No need to wait for sunrise.)
- (is incompatible with the Lin Duo)

171
00:10:45,566 --> 00:10:46,960
- (Or for the rain to stop.)
- (in Universe 3C-091NB,)

172
00:10:46,960 --> 00:10:49,240
(she cannot use
the original host's body)

173
00:10:49,560 --> 00:10:53,280
(and can only inhabit the body
of a woman named Su Yu,)

174
00:10:53,280 --> 00:10:55,680
(108)
(who has just lost all vital signs.)

175
00:10:55,680 --> 00:10:56,560
In the lab,

176
00:10:57,080 --> 00:10:58,560
I linked my mind to yours.

177
00:10:59,560 --> 00:11:00,880
Your thoughts were all mixed up.

178
00:11:01,120 --> 00:11:02,160
I came to save you.

179
00:11:03,320 --> 00:11:05,040
You're not the Lin Duo
from my original universe.

180
00:11:07,960 --> 00:11:08,880
You're here with me.

181
00:11:11,120 --> 00:11:12,120
She's here with you.

182
00:11:15,160 --> 00:11:16,600
We're both yours.

183
00:11:19,200 --> 00:11:20,520
Yours and no one else's.

184
00:11:27,560 --> 00:11:28,080
Duo.

185
00:11:28,560 --> 00:11:29,800
I need to talk to you.

186
00:11:39,720 --> 00:11:40,280
Go on.

187
00:11:41,880 --> 00:11:42,560
What's wrong with me?

188
00:11:43,960 --> 00:11:45,120
This is me.

189
00:11:46,120 --> 00:11:47,520
In my dominant consciousness,

190
00:11:47,960 --> 00:11:49,120
you could be anything,

191
00:11:49,880 --> 00:11:51,840
even a god.

192
00:11:52,960 --> 00:11:53,840
As long as I love you

193
00:11:54,440 --> 00:11:55,160
and you want it,

194
00:11:55,600 --> 00:11:56,120
whatever it is,

195
00:11:56,800 --> 00:11:57,680
I'll give it to you.

196
00:11:58,720 --> 00:11:59,680
I want my Lin Duo.

197
00:12:00,240 --> 00:12:01,040
I am your Lin Duo.

198
00:12:01,960 --> 00:12:03,520
I followed your spacetime channel

199
00:12:03,880 --> 00:12:05,320
to Universe 3C-091NB

200
00:12:05,760 --> 00:12:06,720
just to see you

201
00:12:07,160 --> 00:12:08,160
and be with you.

202
00:12:09,520 --> 00:12:11,040
I mean my Lin Duo.

203
00:12:11,280 --> 00:12:13,280
Not the Lin Duo that Jiang Cheng created
as Subject 108.

204
00:12:19,760 --> 00:12:20,440
Honey.

205
00:12:21,640 --> 00:12:22,840
I am Lin Duo.

206
00:12:23,800 --> 00:12:26,120
I'm the Lin Duo made of your memories.

207
00:12:27,160 --> 00:12:27,880
That's me.

208
00:12:32,040 --> 00:12:32,880
Don't you remember?

209
00:12:33,760 --> 00:12:34,720
You said

210
00:12:35,680 --> 00:12:37,280
no matter what I became,

211
00:12:37,840 --> 00:12:39,040
you'd still love me.

212
00:12:40,840 --> 00:12:42,240
Wasn't I the reason

213
00:12:43,080 --> 00:12:45,800
you had a doctor look for me
in your subconscious?

214
00:12:50,800 --> 00:12:52,880
Universe 3C-091NB.

215
00:12:53,120 --> 00:12:54,520
The method detailed in those files

216
00:12:54,520 --> 00:12:55,920
for invading the subconscious

217
00:12:57,320 --> 00:12:58,360
was something I planted

218
00:12:58,800 --> 00:13:00,800
in the mind of the doctor

219
00:13:01,560 --> 00:13:02,920
who probed your subconscious last time.

220
00:13:05,680 --> 00:13:06,760
I did it

221
00:13:08,600 --> 00:13:09,960
all for you.

222
00:13:11,040 --> 00:13:11,720
Honey.

223
00:13:34,600 --> 00:13:38,040
Tell me you love me.

224
00:13:41,960 --> 00:13:44,280
Launch Perfect Lin Duo Project 109.

225
00:13:44,840 --> 00:13:45,880
Back up and upload

226
00:13:46,000 --> 00:13:48,200
all of Subject Zhang Yongsen's
past memory data.

227
00:13:48,680 --> 00:13:49,640
Begin the merge.

228
00:13:50,480 --> 00:13:52,600
(Current backup data is incomplete.)

229
00:13:52,840 --> 00:13:55,800
(Uploading and merging it as is)

230
00:13:56,040 --> 00:13:58,080
(would create Lin Duo No. 109,)

231
00:13:58,200 --> 00:14:00,720
(with an outcome like Subject 108.)

232
00:14:00,960 --> 00:14:02,200
(The creator's death.)

233
00:14:02,360 --> 00:14:03,320
(107)
High risk.

234
00:14:03,600 --> 00:14:04,680
(Initiating Perfect Lin Duo Project 109)

235
00:14:04,840 --> 00:14:07,720
(is not recommended.)

236
00:14:10,040 --> 00:14:10,560
System.

237
00:14:11,120 --> 00:14:11,720
How long would it take

238
00:14:11,720 --> 00:14:13,400
to find a Zhang Yongsen subject
compatible with

239
00:14:13,400 --> 00:14:14,040
multiple universes?

240
00:14:15,440 --> 00:14:16,240
(Calculations complete.)

241
00:14:16,400 --> 00:14:18,640
(Chance of finding new
living-memory data is)

242
00:14:18,640 --> 00:14:20,160
(less than 10%.)

243
00:14:20,320 --> 00:14:21,760
(Time cannot be estimated.)

244
00:14:22,080 --> 00:14:23,320
Expand the search.

245
00:14:23,560 --> 00:14:25,040
(Detecting emotional data)

246
00:14:25,160 --> 00:14:27,480
(from Subject Zhang Yongsen
in the current universe.)

247
00:14:27,560 --> 00:14:28,480
(Emotional intensity is high.)

248
00:14:28,680 --> 00:14:31,200
(If Subject Zhang Yongsen's mind
returns)

249
00:14:31,280 --> 00:14:32,920
(and uploads this universe's data,)

250
00:14:33,120 --> 00:14:34,920
(the success rate of
the Perfect Lin Duo Project)

251
00:14:35,040 --> 00:14:37,760
(will reach 99.99%.)

252
00:14:37,880 --> 00:14:39,440
Pause the search.

253
00:14:40,600 --> 00:14:41,640
We'll build

254
00:14:41,640 --> 00:14:43,520
the perfect humanoid vessel for Lin Duo.

255
00:14:44,640 --> 00:14:46,800
We'll launch it once the data
comes back.

256
00:14:49,360 --> 00:14:52,040
Add one more rule to
"Do not harm humans":

257
00:14:53,600 --> 00:14:55,960
"Never harm me."

258
00:14:59,040 --> 00:15:00,400
I was created.

259
00:15:01,880 --> 00:15:04,200
I'm Lin Duo, made from your memories.

260
00:15:04,720 --> 00:15:05,800
I'm right here.

261
00:15:06,200 --> 00:15:07,040
I'll never get sick,

262
00:15:07,520 --> 00:15:08,200
never grow old,

263
00:15:08,400 --> 00:15:09,240
and never die.

264
00:15:09,760 --> 00:15:11,920
And you've finally entered
my subconscious.

265
00:15:12,280 --> 00:15:13,760
Let's stay together forever.

266
00:15:14,080 --> 00:15:14,640
Okay?

267
00:15:16,840 --> 00:15:18,040
Duo, please don't.

268
00:15:18,360 --> 00:15:19,080
Duo, stop!

269
00:15:19,720 --> 00:15:20,120
Duo.

270
00:15:25,360 --> 00:15:26,560
Looking for your key, honey?

271
00:15:34,120 --> 00:15:35,320
Are you leaving me, honey?

272
00:15:37,360 --> 00:15:38,000
Why?

273
00:15:39,480 --> 00:15:41,920
I risked never being able to return
to find you.

274
00:15:43,400 --> 00:15:46,560
And now you want to leave?

275
00:15:48,200 --> 00:15:49,160
Duo, please don't.

276
00:15:49,320 --> 00:15:50,080
I'm scared.

277
00:15:50,160 --> 00:15:51,320
Do you even love me?

278
00:15:51,680 --> 00:15:52,680
Do you love the way I look,

279
00:15:52,840 --> 00:15:54,080
or the real me?

280
00:15:57,480 --> 00:16:03,040
(00:29 Countdown)

281
00:16:05,320 --> 00:16:05,840
Auntie,

282
00:16:06,400 --> 00:16:07,360
time's up again.

283
00:16:07,360 --> 00:16:08,480
Why hasn't he woken up?

284
00:16:13,040 --> 00:16:14,880
That makes no sense.

285
00:16:17,200 --> 00:16:18,640
When he hears this music,

286
00:16:19,440 --> 00:16:20,840
he should use his key

287
00:16:20,840 --> 00:16:22,880
to come back, layer by layer.

288
00:16:24,720 --> 00:16:25,840
It doesn't make sense.

289
00:16:27,800 --> 00:16:28,440
Auntie,

290
00:16:29,520 --> 00:16:31,440
what if I slapped him?

291
00:16:31,560 --> 00:16:32,320
Would he wake up?

292
00:16:34,280 --> 00:16:35,040
Not a chance.

293
00:16:36,040 --> 00:16:36,800
Then what do we do?

294
00:16:47,760 --> 00:16:48,400
Honey,

295
00:16:49,440 --> 00:16:51,040
why don't we go inside?

296
00:16:51,480 --> 00:16:52,240
You'll catch a cold.

297
00:16:55,000 --> 00:16:58,520
A lifetime in your fantasy is too short.

298
00:17:01,280 --> 00:17:02,280
Then let's start all over.

299
00:17:03,920 --> 00:17:06,520
From the day
my college acceptance letter arrived.

300
00:17:07,520 --> 00:17:09,360
Skip the job you hated

301
00:17:10,400 --> 00:17:11,360
and that rainy hospital.

302
00:17:12,200 --> 00:17:14,120
It's not about how long life lasts.

303
00:17:14,520 --> 00:17:15,560
You're AI.

304
00:17:16,200 --> 00:17:17,840
Even if you can learn on your own,

305
00:17:18,120 --> 00:17:21,240
you don't understand people's
real emotional triggers.

306
00:17:22,200 --> 00:17:23,680
Time always moves at the same pace.

307
00:17:24,200 --> 00:17:25,880
But in a person's life,

308
00:17:26,000 --> 00:17:27,600
some moments, even in old age,

309
00:17:28,640 --> 00:17:31,000
can make you feel young again.

310
00:17:32,400 --> 00:17:33,400
You want to feel young?

311
00:17:34,160 --> 00:17:35,240
I can help with that.

312
00:17:36,320 --> 00:17:37,520
But I've told you,

313
00:17:38,720 --> 00:17:41,440
don't call me AI.

314
00:17:42,400 --> 00:17:43,520
Whatever you want,

315
00:17:43,840 --> 00:17:44,920
I'll give it to you.

316
00:17:46,240 --> 00:17:47,720
All your children

317
00:17:48,280 --> 00:17:49,680
are highly educated

318
00:17:50,120 --> 00:17:51,200
and completely devoted to you.

319
00:17:51,760 --> 00:17:52,880
Your grandchildren

320
00:17:53,280 --> 00:17:54,720
are all sweet and well-behaved.

321
00:17:55,440 --> 00:17:56,440
Your wife

322
00:17:57,040 --> 00:17:59,040
is always young and beautiful.

323
00:18:00,080 --> 00:18:01,200
Throughout your life,

324
00:18:01,480 --> 00:18:02,640
you never get sick.

325
00:18:04,880 --> 00:18:07,000
What more could anyone want?

326
00:18:07,960 --> 00:18:09,640
I've given you everything,

327
00:18:13,600 --> 00:18:18,240
and you call me AI?

328
00:18:19,520 --> 00:18:21,920
How old did you imagine me to be?

329
00:18:22,760 --> 00:18:24,400
The average human lifespan

330
00:18:25,120 --> 00:18:26,480
is 85 years.

331
00:18:26,720 --> 00:18:28,240
So I'm about to die, right?

332
00:18:28,400 --> 00:18:30,880
After I die, I can escape
from your subconscious.

333
00:18:32,440 --> 00:18:33,120
Honey...

334
00:18:36,680 --> 00:18:38,800
I'm a really fast learner.

335
00:18:40,040 --> 00:18:41,880
Only one in 8,000 paths

336
00:18:42,680 --> 00:18:43,920
leads to a happy ending for humans.

337
00:18:45,200 --> 00:18:47,120
We'll meet and fall in love,

338
00:18:47,760 --> 00:18:49,000
live happily together,

339
00:18:50,280 --> 00:18:51,680
and experience

340
00:18:52,840 --> 00:18:55,680
7,999 other

341
00:18:56,200 --> 00:18:57,160
different

342
00:18:58,840 --> 00:19:00,920
but equally happy endings.

343
00:19:11,076 --> 00:19:12,965
♪I'll find you♪

344
00:19:13,210 --> 00:19:15,743
♪In the silence as the world is reborn♪

345
00:19:16,570 --> 00:19:18,369
♪I'll find you♪

346
00:19:18,888 --> 00:19:21,625
♪In the instant
before anything is decided♪

347
00:19:22,089 --> 00:19:23,909
♪I'll find you♪

348
00:19:24,189 --> 00:19:27,057
♪In the gaps
where time overlaps and slips♪

349
00:19:27,709 --> 00:19:29,709
♪I'll find you♪

350
00:19:33,795 --> 00:19:35,614
♪I'll find you♪

351
00:19:35,710 --> 00:19:38,892
♪In the promises left unsaid♪

352
00:19:39,328 --> 00:19:41,398
♪I'll find you♪

353
00:19:41,428 --> 00:19:44,810
♪In every pause between heartbeats♪

354
00:19:45,068 --> 00:19:51,181
♪I'll find you♪
